    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1323">

                <pb facs="1193" n="935" xml:id="pg935"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to the Ambassador in Austria-Hungary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Penfield</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-17T11:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 17, 1915, 11 a. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>899. Your 897, September 14. On the receipt of information that Mr. Dumba has
                    been definitely recalled, the Department will immediately request safe-conduct
                    for him from the British and French Governments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
